      'article' => '## What is a YouTube Title Generator?

A **YouTube Title Generator** is a specialized tool designed to help creators craft the perfect headline for their videos. In the world of YouTube, your title is one of the most critical factors for **Click-Through Rate (CTR)** and **SEO**. It is the first thing a viewer sees alongside your thumbnail, and it tells the YouTube algorithm what your content is about.

## How It Works

Our generator uses advanced patterns to analyze your topic and tone. Simply enter your main keyword, select a tone (like Clickbait, SEO, or Emotional), and hit generate. Within seconds, you\'ll receive a list of 10–20 optimized titles ready to be copied into your YouTube Studio.

## Why Titles Matter for SEO & CTR

- **Searchability**: Including keywords in your title helps your video show up in Google and YouTube search results.
- **Engagement**: Emotional and click-worthy titles trigger curiosity, leading to more clicks.
- **Algorithm Boost**: Higher CTR signals to YouTube that your video is valuable, prompting them to recommend it to more people.

## Tips for Viral Titles

1. Use **Power Words** like \'Secrets\', \'Insane\', or \'Guaranteed\'.
2. Keep it under **60 characters** to avoid being truncated in search results.
3. Create a **Curiosity Gap** without being misleading (avoid harmful clickbait).',
