      ),
      'article' => 'Welcome to the ultimate tool to **bac calculator**. Understanding your Blood Alcohol Content (BAC) is essential for health, safety, and ensuring you are within legal limits. Our BAC Calculator uses scientifically established formulas (such as the Widmark formula) to provide a reliable estimate of your alcohol metabolism.

