      'article' => 'College academics revolve around your GPA, and our GPA College Calculator is designed specifically for college-level GPA tool. From freshman orientation to graduation day, your grade point average determines scholarship eligibility, academic standing, honors recognition, and post-graduation opportunities. This calculator uses the standard 4.0 scale employed by the vast majority of American colleges and universities.

