      'article' => 'The unweighted GPA uses a standard 4.0 scale, and our Unweighted GPA Calculator provides accurate standard 4.0 scale GPA calculation. Unlike weighted GPA, the unweighted scale treats all courses equally regardless of difficulty level. An A in AP Chemistry earns the same 4.0 as an A in regular English. This straightforward approach is preferred by many colleges for consistent cross-school comparisons.

