      'article' => 'Tracking GPA early builds strong academic habits, and our Middle School GPA Calculator is perfect for middle school student GPA tracking. Middle school and junior high students who understand their GPA gain a significant advantage as they transition to high school, where grades begin to count for college admissions. Building GPA awareness early creates motivation and accountability.

