      'article' => 'Calculate your grade point average from anywhere with our Calculate My GPA Online, designed for free online personal GPA tool. No downloads, no registration, no hidden costs. Just enter your courses, grades, and credit hours to get instant, accurate GPA results in your web browser on any device.

Our web-based GPA calculator uses the standard 4.0 scale recognized by colleges and universities across the United States. The tool supports multiple semesters, plus/minus grading, and variable credit hours. Results update in real time as you enter or modify data, giving you immediate feedback on how each grade affects your overall GPA.

