      'h1' => 'GPA Calculator 4.0 Scale',
      'title' => 'GPA Calculator 4.0 Scale - Free Online Tool | ToolsHub',
      'meta_description' => 'Use our free GPA Calculator 4.0 Scale to calculate your grade point average instantly. Supports weighted GPA, cumulative GPA, and semester GPA on the standard 4.0 scale.',
      'default_options' => 
      array (
      ),
      'article' => 'The unweighted GPA uses a standard 4.0 scale, and our GPA Calculator 4.0 Scale provides accurate standard 4.0 GPA scale computation. Unlike weighted GPA, the unweighted scale treats all courses equally regardless of difficulty level. An A in AP Chemistry earns the same 4.0 as an A in regular English. This straightforward approach is preferred by many colleges for consistent cross-school comparisons.

The unweighted 4.0 scale assigns values as follows: A/A+ = 4.0, A- = 3.7, B+ = 3.3, B = 3.0, B- = 2.7, C+ = 2.3, C = 2.0, C- = 1.7, D+ = 1.3, D = 1.0, F = 0.0. Some schools use simplified scales without plus/minus distinctions. Our calculator supports the full scale with plus/minus grades for maximum accuracy.

Many colleges recalculate submitted GPAs on their own unweighted scale to normalize differences between high schools. The UC system, for example, calculates its own GPA using a specific formula that gives limited bonus points for AP and Honors courses. Understanding your unweighted GPA gives you the most conservative and universally comparable measure of academic performance.

Enter your courses, grade letters, and credit hours into our free tool to calculate your unweighted GPA instantly. No registration required. Track multiple semesters to see your academic trajectory and make informed decisions about your study habits and course planning.',
