      ),
      'article' => 'University students need reliable tools for academic planning, and our LSU GPA Calculator provides accurate results for Louisiana State University GPA tool. Every university uses GPA as a key metric for academic standing, scholarship eligibility, honors programs, and graduation requirements. Our calculator uses the standard 4.0 grading scale adopted by virtually all American universities.

