      'article' => 'Tracking GPA early builds strong academic habits, and our GPA Calculator for Junior High is perfect for junior high school GPA tool. Middle school and junior high students who understand their GPA gain a significant advantage as they transition to high school, where grades begin to count for college admissions. Building GPA awareness early creates motivation and accountability.

