      'article' => 'University students need reliable tools for academic planning, and our GPA Calculator UF provides accurate results for University of Florida GPA computation. Every university uses GPA as a key metric for academic standing, scholarship eligibility, honors programs, and graduation requirements. Our calculator uses the standard 4.0 grading scale adopted by virtually all American universities.

