      ),
      'article' => 'Predicting school closures requires analyzing multiple data points, and our Snow Day Predictor Calculator excels at predicting snow days with algorithms by combining weather and infrastructure factors. Snow day predictors go beyond simple snowfall amounts to consider the full picture of conditions that school administrators evaluate before making their early-morning closure calls.

