The most reliable predictions come from combining quantitative weather data with qualitative knowledge about local school district behavior. Some districts are known as "early closers" that cancel at 3 inches of snow, while others are "late closers" that wait until 6+ inches. Understanding your local district\'s tendencies can help you interpret our calculator\'s output more accurately.

