      'article' => 'Artificial intelligence is transforming weather prediction, and our AI Snow Day Calculator represents AI-powered snow day prediction at its best. Traditional snow day calculators use fixed formulas, but AI-enhanced models can learn from historical patterns, adapt to regional differences, and improve predictions with each winter season\'s data.

