      'article' => 'A snow day is every student\'s dream during winter, and our Best Snow Day Calculator helps you estimate the best snow day prediction tool available with ease. When winter storms roll in and snowflakes start piling up, the big question on every student\'s mind is: will school be cancelled tomorrow? Our calculator uses weather factors including snowfall amount, ice conditions, wind speed, and regional infrastructure to estimate the probability of a school closure.

