Monday closures are particularly impactful because they often follow weekend storms where plowing may have been less aggressive. Tuesday through Thursday closures tend to have the most consistent thresholds because they occur mid-week without the Monday catchup or Friday weekend effect. Wednesday closures sometimes trigger multi-day closures if a storm system is expected to continue.

