        'tool_slug' => 'cross-multiplication-calculator',
        'h1' => 'Cross Multiplication Calculator – Solve Proportions',
        'title' => 'Cross Multiplication Calculator - Solve for x in Proportions | ToolsHub',
        'meta_description' => 'Solve any proportion with our cross multiplication calculator. Just enter three known values to find the fourth missing variable instantly.',
        'article' => '## Understanding Cross Multiplication
Cross multiplication is a mathematical technique used to solve for a missing variable in an equation where two ratios are equal (a/b = c/d). The rule states that the product of the means equals the product of the extremes (a*d = b*c).',
        'faq' => 
