            'a' => 'Yes, while the primary focus is circumference, the tool also provides the area using the exact formula Area = π * a * b.',
          ),
          4 => 
          array (
            'q' => 'What is eccentricity?',
            'a' => 'Eccentricity (e) measures how "stretched out" the ellipse is. A circle has an eccentricity of 0. As e approaches 1, the ellipse becomes flatter.',
          ),
