      'article' => '## Simplifying Improper Fractions to Mixed Numbers

While 7/4 is mathematically correct, many people prefer to see it as 1 3/4, especially when measuring physical objects.

### Step-by-Step Guide
1. **Divide:** See how many times the denominator goes into the numerator fully. (7 / 4 = 1 with a remainder).
