      'h1' => 'Electricity Cost of Bitcoin Mining Calculator',
      'title' => 'Bitcoin Mining Electricity Cost Calculator - Profitability Analysis | ToolsHub',
      'meta_description' => 'Calculate the electricity cost of Bitcoin mining. Analyze daily, monthly, and yearly power costs with pool fees, cooling overhead, and profitability metrics.',
      'instructions' => 
