          'q' => 'Is Bitcoin mining still profitable in 2024?',
          'a' => 'It depends primarily on your electricity cost. At under $0.07/kWh with modern ASICs, mining can be profitable. Above $0.12/kWh, profitability becomes very difficult unless BTC price rises significantly.',
