        2 => 
        array (
          'q' => 'Why do companies write off Goodwill?',
          'a' => 'If the acquired company underperforms or loses its brand dominance, the parent company must perform annual impairment tests. If the fair value drops below the book value, the goodwill must be permanently written off via the income statement.',
        ),
