        array (
          'q' => 'Is it the Rule of 72 or Rule of 69.3?',
          'a' => 'The number 69.3 is technically more accurate for continuous compounding (derived directly from the natural log curve). However, 72 is used universally because it is easily divisible by 2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 9, and 12.',
