          'q' => 'Does the Kelly Criterion guarantee I will not lose money?',
          'a' => 'No strategy prevents losing trades. However, if your inputs (Win Rate and Ratio) are genuinely accurate, and you strictly obey the Kelly output percentage, it becomes mathematically impossible to reduce your bankroll to absolute zero.',
        ),
        1 => 
