          'q' => 'How does daily compounding compare to monthly compounding?',
          'a' => 'Daily compounding accelerates wealth generation by reinvesting earned interest 365 times a year instead of just 12. Because the principal increases every single day, the subsequent daily interest yields are calculated on a slightly larger base, resulting in a noticeably steeper exponential growth curve over time.',
