          'a' => 'Reinvesting 100% of your interest maximizes exponential growth but also maximizes risk exposure. In volatile markets like cryptocurrency or leveraged forex, a sudden drawdown can instantly wipe out compounded gains. Many professional traders take partial profits to secure capital while compounding the remainder.',
