        array (
          'q' => 'Why does Wall Street strictly fixate on EBITDA instead of traditional Net Income?',
          'a' => 'Net Income is explicitly highly vulnerable to aggressive structural accounting manipulation. Extreme depreciation write-downs or complex localized taxation strategies completely artificially destroy Net Profit. EBITDA actively strips all operational noise, exclusively isolating the pure, unadorned fundamental cash-printing capability generated specifically from the physical underlying business operations.',
