                <li><strong>Tangible Logic:</strong> Switch seamlessly between raw and tangible book value.</li>
                <li><strong>Liquidation Insights:</strong> Identify assets trading below their physical cash value.</li>
                <li><strong>Sector Overlays:</strong> Contextualize results based on banking vs. industrial norms.</li>
            </ul>
        ',
