      'meta_description' => 'Use our free Army Body Fat Calculator to accurately calculate your military fitness metrics. Professional formulas, instant results, and 100% privacy.',
      'default_options' => 
      array (
      ),
      'article' => 'Optimizing your physical health and performance requires precise data and reliable metrics. The Army Body Fat Calculator is a professional-grade utility designed to provide clear, actionable insights into your military fitness measurements. Whether you are a competitive athlete, a healthcare professional, or simply a wellness enthusiast, our tools use validated formulas and standardized clinical metrics.

Our Army Body Fat Calculator removes the guesswork from health monitoring. From calculating complex body composition markers to evaluating multi-factorial medical ratios, our engine processes your inputs instantly. We use industry-standard models such as the U.S. Navy Circumference method, the CKD-EPI equation, and the Karvonen formula to ensure that every result meets professional standards.

At ToolsHub, we believe that advanced health and fitness analytics should be accessible to everyone. Our commitment to privacy means that all calculations are performed locally, and your personal data is never stored on our servers. Simply enter your metrics, view your detailed results, and take the next step in your health journey with confidence.',
      'faq' => 
      array (
        0 => 
        array (
          'q' => 'How accurate are the results?',
          'a' => 'Our engine uses industry-standard formulas (e.g., Du Bois for BSA, CKD-EPI for GFR). However, results are for informational purposes only.',
        ),
        1 => 
        array (
          'q' => 'Is my data stored?',
          'a' => 'No. All calculations are processed locally in your browser. We never see or store your medical or fitness data.',
        ),
        2 => 
